{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101240","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210124001:0":{"text":"멈춰요! 치피를 건드리지 말라구욧!","source_cn":"住手！不许动满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE15E77AEECE60A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210124002:0":{"text":"아는 사이야? 이 바다 쥐도 이름이 있어?","source_cn":"你们认识？这海耗子还有名字？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A531A7FDCE8DF47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210124003:0":{"text":"치피, 일어나 봐!","source_cn":"满满，你醒醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4910AA4BE87FEA46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210124004:0":{"text":"어떻게 이럴 수가... 안색이 너무 안 좋아요... 치피가 꿈쩍도 안 해요!","source_cn":"怎么会……他脸色好差……满满他不动了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD4BDB9CA30D441","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210124005:0":{"text":"이봐, 상태가 심각해! 인공 호흡해 본 적 없어?!","source_cn":"喂，这溺水得很严重！你们做过人工呼吸吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EBA6225AE8A251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210124006:0":{"text":"이, 인공 호흡을 어떻게 해? 난 저게 뭔지도 모른다고!","source_cn":"这、这怎么做人工呼吸？我连他是什么都不知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0923CCCEDA4800E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210124007:0":{"text":"...우리는 서머너예요!! 치피를 함부로 말하지 마요!!","source_cn":"——我们是使魔！！不许说满满什么都不是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B843431D65F486E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210124008:0":{"text":"흑... 치피, 일어나 봐...!","source_cn":"呜……满满，醒醒呀……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB165000BBE5F8D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210124009:0":{"text":"쯧, 이런 건 구해 본 적이 없어서... 이봐, 뭐 뾰족한 방법 없어?","source_cn":"啧，没救过这样的……喂，你有招吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x66F8EDFDE44BA18C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"쯧, 이런 건 구해 본 적이 없어서... 이봐, 뭐 뾰족한 방법 없어?","female":"쯧, 이런 건 구해 본 적이 없어서... 이봐, 뭐 뾰족한 방법 없어?","variant_male_record_index":"127578","variant_female_record_index":"127579","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1210124009":{"text":"쯧, 이런 건 구해 본 적이 없어서... 이봐, 뭐 뾰족한 방법 없어?","source_cn":"啧，没救过这样的……喂，你有招吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x66F8EDFDE44BA18C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"쯧, 이런 건 구해 본 적이 없어서... 이봐, 뭐 뾰족한 방법 없어?","female":"쯧, 이런 건 구해 본 적이 없어서... 이봐, 뭐 뾰족한 방법 없어?","variant_male_record_index":"127578","variant_female_record_index":"127579","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210124010:0":{"text":"아, 참! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 마법이요!","source_cn":"对、对了！<style=stress><player_...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE767F7276C7FBDB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아, 참! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 마법이요!","female":"아, 참! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 마법이요!","variant_male_record_index":"127580","variant_female_record_index":"127581","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210124011:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">호흡 포션</style>이 있다면 치피가 괜찮아질 거예요!","source_cn":"要是有<style=highlight>呼吸药剂</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76FCED7F0410C7A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210124012:1":{"text":"방법이 있으면 돼! 그건 어디서 구하는 건데?","source_cn":"有招就行！东西去哪找？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6DF58E8CDB25394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210124013:0":{"text":"윽, 그건 골드 크라운 레벨의 마법 포션 가게에서만 팔 거예요. 재료만 있다면 용광로에서 직접 정제해도 될 텐데...!","source_cn":"呃，金冠级的魔法药剂店会卖，有材料的话，直接用坩埚炼制...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9388C2AE59D8002A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210124014:1":{"text":"무슨 말을 하는 건지 통 모르겠네. 어쨌든, 약을 찾는다는 거지?","source_cn":"听不懂，总之是要找药，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x237A264C63BF3636","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210124015:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">업타운</style>에 포션 가게가 있으니 내가 다녀올게. 우선 목숨이 가장 중요하니.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>上城区</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8138006EB666F3B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210124016:0":{"text":"잠깐, 저도 갈게요. 제가 뭔지 아니까요!","source_cn":"等等，我也去，你认不出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0831549F22E31ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"마법을 써볼까...?","source_cn":"用魔法试试……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x745A49407D7388C6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마법을 써볼까...?","female":"마법을 써볼까...?","variant_male_record_index":"64836","variant_female_record_index":"64837","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"해미, 걱정 마. 그 전에...","source_cn":"漫漫别慌，之前……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA1B90E259DFB1581","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"해미, 걱정 마. 그 전에...","female":"해미, 걱정 마. 그 전에...","variant_male_record_index":"64838","variant_female_record_index":"64839","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫